  "description": "Connects the OASIS to OrbitDB via the orbit-db-http-api REST server. OrbitDB is a serverless, distributed, peer-to-peer database built on IPFS. Requires a running orbit-db-http-api server instance. No OrbitDB SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
